---
description: Rules for loading and cleaning OHLC bid/ask CSV data
globs: **/*data*.py, **/*load*.py, cleandata/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---
- Data lives in lowercase `data/` (Linux is case-sensitive — never write `Data/`).
- CSVs hold OHLC BID and ASK — always confirm which columns you're reading.
- Parse dates explicitly; set and sort a timezone-aware datetime index.
- Handle NaNs, gaps, and duplicate timestamps before use.
- Fail loudly on missing/malformed files — no silent empty DataFrames.